Okay, sunscreen.

67
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:14,360
Now this is a liquid and you put it on your skin, right?

68
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:18,000
And this protects you from the sun.

69
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:26,250
So basically you put this cream all over your body to prevent sunburns, to prevent burning under the sun.

70
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,800
It's very important.

71
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:31,050
So it's called sunscreen or also sometimes called sunblock.

72
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:31,970
That's right.

73
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,090
Okay, very good.

74
